#: ../../site/performance.md:1
msgid "Performance method and limits"
msgstr "性能方法与局限"

#: ../../site/performance.md:3
msgid ""
"A performance claim is only meaningful with six things attached: the "
"workload, the data scale, the CPU and thread settings, the environment, the "
"statistic, and how noise was handled. This page states how the repository's "
"numbers were produced so a reader can judge, or reproduce, them."
msgstr "一条性能结论只有附带六件事才有意义：负载、数据规模、CPU 与线程设置、环境、统计量与噪声处理方式。本页说明仓库里的数字是如何产生的，以便读者判断或复现。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:8
msgid "How the harness measures"
msgstr "测量方式"

#: ../../site/performance.md:10
msgid ""
"The paired harness runs the pinned Python reference and the native candidate"
" on the same machine, alternating them, with one CPU pinned for the measured"
" child:"
msgstr "成对基准在同一台机器上交替运行固定的 Python 参考实现与原生候选实现，并为被测子进程绑定一个 CPU："

#: ../../site/performance.md:13
msgid ""
"Each measured run is a **child process** whose affinity is narrowed before "
"`CreateProcess`/`fork` and verified after start, so the parent's scheduler "
"choices cannot leak into the measurement."
msgstr "每次测量都是一个**子进程**：在 `CreateProcess`/`fork` 之前收窄其亲和性，启动后校验，因此父进程的调度选择不会渗入测量。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:16
msgid ""
"The wall interval starts immediately before the child is created and ends "
"when it exits, so interpreter start-up and loader time are **inside** the "
"measurement for both sides."
msgstr "墙钟区间从创建子进程之前开始，到子进程退出结束，因此解释器启动与加载时间都**计入**两侧测量。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:19
msgid ""
"Warm-up runs are excluded; the observer (digest capture, counters) runs "
"after the stop clock, except the allocation counter, whose atomics fire "
"inside the measured call."
msgstr "预热运行被排除；观察者（摘要捕获、计数器）在停止时钟之后运行，唯一例外是分配计数器 —— 它的原子操作在测量调用内部触发。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:22
msgid ""
"CPU time and peak working set come from the operating system's process "
"accounting, not from a self-report."
msgstr "CPU 时间与峰值工作集来自操作系统的进程记账，而不是自报。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:24
msgid ""
"Correctness is a **gate**, not a separate report: the research tables "
"produced during the run are compared by digest before the timing is "
"accepted."
msgstr "正确性是**门禁**，不是另一份报告：运行期间产出的研究表会先按摘要比对通过，计时才会被采纳。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:27
msgid ""
"Pairs are alternated and summarised by the median, so a single slow run "
"cannot become the headline. A campaign that cannot separate the noise is "
"recorded as INCONCLUSIVE rather than rounded up into a speed-up."
msgstr "配对交替进行并用中位数汇总，因此单次慢跑不会变成头条数字。无法与噪声区分开的评估记为 INCONCLUSIVE，而不是四舍五入成加速比。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:31
msgid "What the numbers mean"
msgstr "这些数字怎么读"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Result"
msgstr "结果"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "解读"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "**41.20x** on the Alpha003 500-file development batch"
msgstr "Alpha003 500 文件开发批的 **41.20x**"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Wall-clock ratio for that workload, five measured pairs, same CPU"
msgstr "该负载的墙钟比，五次测量配对，同一 CPU"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "**34.46x / 35.63x** on the 1,000 / 2,000-file diagnostic pairs"
msgstr "1,000 / 2,000 文件诊断对的 **34.46x / 35.63x**"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "The ratio moves with scale; these are separate diagnostic pairs, not a gate"
msgstr "比值随规模变化；这是独立的诊断对，不是门禁"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Peak working set"
msgstr "峰值工作集"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid ""
"Reported separately; a faster run that uses much more memory is not a free "
"win"
msgstr "单独报告；更快但内存占用高得多的运行不是免费的胜利"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Digest equality"
msgstr "摘要一致"

#: ../../site/performance.md
msgid "Every accepted timing run also reproduced the reference tables"
msgstr "每个被采纳的计时运行同时也复现了参考表"

#: ../../site/performance.md:40
msgid ""
"The x-factor is a ratio of wall-clock time for **one workload** on **one "
"host**. It is not a claim about every API, about the full corpus, or about a"
" different machine. The historical CSV-export benchmark and the current HTML"
" research benchmark are different workloads and are not interchangeable."
msgstr "x 倍数是**一个负载**在**一台主机**上的墙钟时间比。它不是对所有 API、对整个语料库或对另一台机器的结论。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:45
msgid "Reproducing a measurement"
msgstr "复现一次测量"

#: ../../site/performance.md:47
msgid ""
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_alpha003_research\n"
"python benchmarks/alpha003_a_stocks/run_benchmark.py --help\n"
msgstr ""
"cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release\n"
"cmake --build build --parallel --target fincore_alpha003_research\n"
"python benchmarks/alpha003_a_stocks/run_benchmark.py --help\n"

#: ../../site/performance.md:53
msgid ""
"The benchmark sources and the data-preparation steps are committed; the "
"generated HTML reports and CSV payloads are not. Read the driver's `--help` "
"for the supported pair counts, tolerance ceiling and output locations, and "
"keep the default `--tolerance` (it must be finite and at most `1e-6`)."
msgstr ""
"基准源码与数据准备步骤已提交；生成的 HTML 报告与 CSV 载荷不入库。驱动器的 `--help` 给出支持的配对数、容差上限与输出位置，并保持默认"
" `--tolerance`（必须是有限值且不超过 `1e-6`）。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:58
msgid "Limits and honest gaps"
msgstr "局限与诚实的空白"

#: ../../site/performance.md:60
msgid ""
"Measurements were taken on a single desktop-class machine with one core "
"pinned; no cloud or container claim is implied."
msgstr "测量在单台桌面级机器上完成，只绑定一个核心；不暗示云或容器环境下的结论。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:62
msgid ""
"A noisy environment produces INCONCLUSIVE campaigns. Those records stay in "
"the repository; they are not summarised into a stable speed-up."
msgstr "噪声环境会产出 INCONCLUSIVE 的评估记录。这些记录留在仓库里；它们不会被汇总成一个稳定的加速比。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:64
msgid ""
"Memory is reported as peak working set, which is not the same as the "
"allocator's live bytes; the native harness tracks both when the allocation "
"hooks are built."
msgstr "内存以峰值工作集报告，这与分配器的存活字节不是一回事；开启分配钩子时原生基准两者都记录。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:66
msgid ""
"Comparing a workload that materialises every intermediate row against one "
"that streams will always look dramatic; compare outputs before you compare "
"times."
msgstr "把物化每个中间行的负载与流式负载相比总会显得悬殊；请先比较输出，再比较时间。"

#: ../../site/performance.md:69
msgid ""
"For the exact campaign records — pair counts, machine, dates and verdicts — "
"see the iteration 9 closeout and the acceptance records linked from the "
"repository root."
msgstr "精确的评估记录 —— 配对数、机器、日期与结论 —— 见迭代 9 收尾记录与仓库根目录链接的验收记录。"

